{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b8a9c0d1-e2f3-4a5b-6c7d-8e9f0a1b2c3d",
    "name": "PINAK Mobile App — Auth & OTP Collection",
    "description": "# PINAK Mobile App — Authentication & OTP Collection\n\nProduction-grade Postman collection for the **PINAK Mobile Super-App Authentication Subsystem** (Screens 05–08).\n\n### 🔐 Database OTP Architecture\n- **Table**: PostgreSQL `mobile_otps` (Flyway Migration `V8__add_pinak_mobile_onboarding_fields.sql`).\n- **No Mock OTPs**: Codes are generated randomly and securely, recorded in the database, delivered via SMS/WhatsApp, and verified using constant-time `MessageDigest.isEqual`.\n- **Cooldown & Brute-Force**: 60-second cooldown rate limit per phone; maximum 5 failed attempts before challenge lockout.\n\n### 🗄️ Querying Active OTP from PostgreSQL:\n```sql\nSELECT phone, otp_code, session_id, expires_at, attempts, is_consumed \nFROM mobile_otps \nWHERE phone = '+919876543210' \nORDER BY created_at DESC \nLIMIT 1;\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
